          "title": "You'll want to know: مهنة",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مهنة — mihna — \"a profession, a trade\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مهنة (mihna) أبي التدريس. mihnat abī at-tadrīs. My father's profession is teaching."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: مهن, mihan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مهنة (mihna) is built on the native Arabic root m-h-n, \"to serve, to work\" (Lane). Mihna is the work one serves at."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
