            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "يطمح ابني إلى أن يصبح طيارا. yaṭmaḥu ibnī ilā an yuṣbiḥa ṭayyāran. My son aspires to become a pilot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present: يطمح, yaṭmaḥ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It takes إلى. Ṭumūḥ, ambition, which you know, is its noun."
            }
          ]
        },
