          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "طمح (ṭamaḥa) is built on the native Arabic root ṭ-m-ḥ, \"to raise the eyes towards\" (Lane). Lane gives ṭamaḥa of the sight, raised towards a thing."
